[--><!--[--><a href="https://brila.ai">Brila</a><!--]--><!--[--><a href="/mcp">Icons8 MCP</a><!--]--><!--[--><a href="https://generated.photos/human-generator">Human Generator</a><!--]--><!--[--><a href="/swapper">Face Swapper</a><!--]--><!--[--><a href="/illustration-generator/new">AI illustration generator</a><!--]--><!--[--><a href="/upscaler">Smart Upscaler</a><!--]--><!--[--><a href="https://generated.photos/faces">Generated faces</a><!--]--><!--[--><a href="https://generated.photos/humans">Generated full-body</a><!--]--><!--[--><a href="https://generated.photos/genyou">GenYOU</a><!--]--><!--[--><a href="https://generated.photos/anonymizer">AI Anonymizer</a><!--]--><!--[--><a href="https://generated.photos/api">Generated Photos API</a><!--]--><!--[--><a href="https://developers.icons8.com/docs/upscaler">Smart Upscaler API</a><!--]--><!--[--><a href="https://developers.brila.ai/">Brila API</a><!--]--><!--[--><a href="https://developers.icons8.com/">All developer tools</a><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></nav></header><!--[--><div class="license-page" data-v-79a31b91><div class="license-page__bg-block" data-v-79a31b91></div><div class="license-page__container" data-v-79a31b91><section class="hero-section license-page__hero" data-v-79a31b91 data-v-b6499311><div class="hero-section__content" data-v-b6499311><h1 data-v-b6499311>How to use our graphics for free</h1><div class="hero-section__desc" data-v-b6499311>Here&#39;s the deal. We share our assets with you, you set a link to icons8.com wherever you use them. You get top-notch graphics for free, we get some exposure. A win-win! Below you find example with the most frequent use cases.</div><a href="https://intercom.help/icons8-7fb7577e8170/en/articles/5534926-universal-multimedia-licensing-agreement-for-icons8" class="hero-section__link-btn" data-v-b6499311><button class="_button_15ir8_107 _outline_15ir8_197 _large_15ir8_144" type="button" data-test="i8-button" data-v-b6499311><!----><!----><span class="_content_15ir8_149"><span class="_iconLeft_15ir8_152" data-test="i8-button--icon-left"><!--[--><img src="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/document.svg" alt="document" class="hero-section__btn-icon" data-v-b6499311><!--]--></span><span class="_label_15ir8_317" data-test="i8-button--label"><!--[--> Read full license<!--]--></span><!----></span></button></a></div></section><div class="tagging-section license-page__section" data-v-79a31b91 data-v-465806ae><!--[--><div class="tagging-section__block" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-title" data-v-465806ae>Websites and apps</div><div class="tagging-section__block-grid" data-v-465806ae><!--[--><div class="tagging-section__block-item" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-wrapper" data-v-465806ae><img srcset="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/websites2x.webp 2x, https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/websites1x.webp 1x" alt="Icons8 in website footer" class="tagging-section__block-item-icon" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-border" data-v-465806ae></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-title" data-v-465806ae>Websites</div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-desc" data-v-465806ae>Add a link to <a href="/" target="_blank">icons8.com</a> on all pages using our content. If that's most pages, a link in your footer is fine.</div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-wrapper" data-v-465806ae><img srcset="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/desktopApps2x.webp 2x, https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/desktopApps1x.webp 1x" alt="Icons8 in desktop app" class="tagging-section__block-item-icon" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-border" data-v-465806ae></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-title" data-v-465806ae>Desktop apps</div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-desc" data-v-465806ae>Add a link to <a href="/" target="_blank">icons8.com</a> to the About section.</div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-wrapper" data-v-465806ae><img srcset="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/mobileApps2x.webp 2x, https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/mobileApps1x.webp 1x" alt="Icons8 in mobile app" class="tagging-section__block-item-icon" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-border" data-v-465806ae></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-title" data-v-465806ae>Mobile apps</div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-desc" data-v-465806ae>Add a link to <a href="/" target="_blank">icons8.com</a> in the About section or Settings. Also, please credit us in your App Store or Google Play description.</div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-title" data-v-465806ae>Social media</div><div class="tagging-section__block-grid" data-v-465806ae><!--[--><div class="tagging-section__block-item" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-wrapper" data-v-465806ae><img srcset="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/twitter2x.webp 2x, https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/twitter1x.webp 1x" alt="Icons8 in Twitter post" class="tagging-section__block-item-icon" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-border" data-v-465806ae></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-title" data-v-465806ae>Twitter</div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-desc" data-v-465806ae>Tag <a href="https://twitter.com/icons_8" target="_blank">@icons_8</a> in tweets with our graphics. Chances are that we might retweet them.</div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-wrapper" data-v-465806ae><img srcset="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/facebook2x.webp 2x, https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/facebook1x.webp 1x" alt="Icons8 in Facebook post" class="tagging-section__block-item-icon" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-border" data-v-465806ae></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-title" data-v-465806ae>Facebook</div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-desc" data-v-465806ae>Tag <a href="https://www.facebook.com/Icons8" target="_blank">@icons8</a> in posts with our graphics.</div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-wrapper" data-v-465806ae><img srcset="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/instagram2x.webp 2x, https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/instagram1x.webp 1x" alt="Icons8 in Instagram post" class="tagging-section__block-item-icon" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-border" data-v-465806ae></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-title" data-v-465806ae>Instagram</div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-desc" data-v-465806ae>Mentions of <a href="https://www.instagram.com/icons8/" target="_blank">@icons8</a>, tagging <a href="https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/icons8/" target="_blank">#icons8</a>, using sticker links to <a href="/" target="_blank">icons8.com</a>, or their combinations are all fine.</div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-title" data-v-465806ae>Digital products</div><div class="tagging-section__block-grid" data-v-465806ae><!--[--><div class="tagging-section__block-item" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-wrapper" data-v-465806ae><img srcset="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/presentations2x.webp 2x, https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/presentations1x.webp 1x" alt="Icons8 in presentation" class="tagging-section__block-item-icon" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-border" data-v-465806ae></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-title" data-v-465806ae>Presentations</div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-desc" data-v-465806ae>Mention <a href="/" target="_blank">icons8.com</a> on the slides with our content or on the final slide.</div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-wrapper" data-v-465806ae><img srcset="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/ebooks2x.webp 2x, https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/ebooks1x.webp 1x" alt="Icons8 in ebook" class="tagging-section__block-item-icon" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-border" data-v-465806ae></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-title" data-v-465806ae>E-books</div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-desc" data-v-465806ae>Mention or add a link to <a href="/" target="_blank">icons8.com</a> in the copyright section of the book or on the pages with our graphics.</div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-wrapper" data-v-465806ae><img srcset="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/games2x.webp 2x, https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/games1x.webp 1x" alt="Icons8 in game Credits" class="tagging-section__block-item-icon" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-border" data-v-465806ae></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-title" data-v-465806ae>Indie games</div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-desc" data-v-465806ae>Mention us in the Credits section. And we would love to have a copy of the game!</div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-title" data-v-465806ae>Other</div><div class="tagging-section__block-grid" data-v-465806ae><!--[--><div class="tagging-section__block-item" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-wrapper" data-v-465806ae><img srcset="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/printouts2x.webp 2x, https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/printouts1x.webp 1x" alt="Icons8 in menu" class="tagging-section__block-item-icon" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-border" data-v-465806ae></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-title" data-v-465806ae>Printouts</div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-desc" data-v-465806ae>Mention Icons8 anywhere in the document.</div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-wrapper" data-v-465806ae><img srcset="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/goods2x.webp 2x, https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/goods1x.webp 1x" alt="Icons8 on coffee cup" class="tagging-section__block-item-icon" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-border" data-v-465806ae></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-title" data-v-465806ae>Physical goods</div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-desc" data-v-465806ae>Put a link either on your website if you have one, description of the item, or on the physical product itself, if possible. The reference must be legible.</div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-wrapper" data-v-465806ae><img srcset="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/research2x.webp 2x, https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/research1x.webp 1x" alt="Icons8 in research" class="tagging-section__block-item-icon" data-v-465806ae><div class="tagging-section__block-item-border" data-v-465806ae></div></div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-title" data-v-465806ae>Academic and scientific research</div><div class="tagging-section__block-item-desc" data-v-465806ae>Mention <a href="/" target="_blank">icons8.com</a> in references or captions.</div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--><div class="tagging-section__read-more" data-v-465806ae>Not your case? <a class="tagging-section__read-more-link _link_jdvms_107" href="https://intercom.help/icons8-7fb7577e8170/en/articles/4725508-where-do-i-add-the-link" data-test="i8-link" data-v-465806ae><span class="_content_jdvms_132"><!----><!--[-->Read more here<!--]--><!----></span></a></div></div><div class="license-type-section license-page__section-big-margin" data-v-79a31b91 data-v-8e991aa5><!--[--><div class="license-type-section__type" data-v-8e991aa5><div data-v-8e991aa5><div class="license-type-section__type-title" data-v-8e991aa5>Open-source</div><div class="license-type-section__type-desc" data-v-8e991aa5>Established open-source projects can get our graphics for free. For you, we&#39;ll open-source the needed resources.</div><button class="license-type-section__contact _link_jdvms_107" data-test="i8-link" data-v-8e991aa5><span class="_content_jdvms_132"><!----><!--[-->Contact us<!--]--><!----></span></button></div><div class="license-type-section__type-wrapper" data-v-8e991aa5><img src="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/openSource.svg" alt="Icons8 for open source" class="license-type-section__type-icon" data-v-8e991aa5><div class="license-type-section__type-border" data-v-8e991aa5></div></div></div><div class="license-type-section__type" data-v-8e991aa5><div data-v-8e991aa5><div class="license-type-section__type-title" data-v-8e991aa5>Education</div><div class="license-type-section__type-desc" data-v-8e991aa5>We also offer free Educational licenses to universities and other academic institutions. Chat with our support team to learn more.</div><button class="license-type-section__contact _link_jdvms_107" data-test="i8-link" data-v-8e991aa5><span class="_content_jdvms_132"><!----><!--[-->Contact us<!--]--><!----></span></button></div><div class="license-type-section__type-wrapper" data-v-8e991aa5><img src="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/education.svg" alt="Icons8 for education" class="license-type-section__type-icon" data-v-8e991aa5><div class="license-type-section__type-border" data-v-8e991aa5></div></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="buy-info-section license-page__section-big-margin" data-v-79a31b91 data-v-77253791><div data-v-77253791><div class="buy-info-section__title" data-v-77253791><div data-v-77253791>Don&#39;t want to set links?</div><div data-v-77253791>Buy a license</div></div><div class="buy-info-section__desc" data-v-77253791>Additionally, you&#39;ll have access to all formats, sizes, features, and free unlimited Coke.</div><a href="/pricing" class="buy-info-section__check-pricing _link_jdvms_107" data-test="i8-link" data-v-77253791><span class="_content_jdvms_132"><!----><!--[-->Check pricing <img src="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/arrowRight.svg" class="buy-info-section__check-pricing-icon" alt="right arrow" data-v-77253791><!--]--><!----></span></a></div><div class="buy-info-section__true-story-wrap" data-v-77253791><div class="buy-info-section__true-story" data-v-77253791><div class="buy-info-section__true-story-title" data-v-77253791><img src="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/zanyFace.svg" alt="zany emoji" data-v-77253791> A true story</div><div class="buy-info-section__true-story-desc" data-v-77253791>One <a href="/icons/set/girl">girl</a> didn't add a <a href="/icons/set/link">link</a>, and for two years, she had no decent dates. Another <a href="/icons/set/guy">guy</a>, who did add a link, got a #1 ranking on <a href="/icons/set/google">Google!</a></div></div><img src="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/landings/license/thinkingFace.svg" class="buy-info-section__true-story-img" alt="thinking emoji" data-v-77253791></div></div><div class="license-page__comments license-page__section-big-margin" data-v-79a31b